{"orgCode":"8885","name":"Commission on State Mandates","agencyCode":"8000","agencyName":"General Government","description":"The Commission on State Mandates timely renders sound, quasi-judicial decisions, in compliance with Article XIII B, Section 6 of the California Constitution, resolving disputes regarding reimbursement for state-mandated local programs and relieving unnecessary congestion of the courts. Its mission is to fairly and impartially hear and determine matters filed by state and local government; resolve complex legal questions in a deliberative and timely manner; and produce clear, well-reasoned, and lawful decisions.\n\nThe Commission is a quasi-judicial body consisting of the Director of Finance, the State Controller, the State Treasurer, the Director of the Office of Planning and Research, a public member with experience in public finance, and two members from the categories of city council member, county supervisor, or school district governing board member, appointed by the Governor and approved by the Senate.","totals":{"amounts":{"py":90478,"cy":97314,"by":93866},"positions":{"py":15,"cy":16.5,"by":16.5}},"programs":{"id":"exp/8000/8885","kind":"department","name":"Commission on State Mandates","code":"8885","amounts":{"py":90478,"cy":97314,"by":93866},"positions":{"py":15,"cy":16.5,"by":16.5},"byFundType":{"general":{"py":88537,"cy":94854,"by":90920},"special":{"py":1941,"cy":2460,"by":2946}},"children":[{"id":"exp/8000/8885/6900","kind":"program","name":"Administration","code":"6900","amounts":{"py":3161,"cy":3211,"by":3259},"byFundType":{"general":{"py":3161,"cy":3211,"by":3259}},"positions":{"py":15,"cy":16.5,"by":16.5},"description":"6900 - ADMINISTRATION\n\nThe Commission's statutory responsibilities are to hear and decide:\n\n• Test claims of local agencies and school districts that allege the existence of reimbursable state-mandated programs; and if a test claim is approved, adopt parameters and guidelines for claiming reimbursement and prepare a statewide cost estimate.\n\n• Claims alleging that the State Controller's Office has incorrectly reduced payments to local agencies and school districts.\n\n• Requests for mandate redeterminations that allege the state's liability for a mandate has been modified based on a subsequent change in law.\n\n• Requests to review the claiming instructions issued by the State Controller.\n\n• Requests to determine whether a mandated program, for which appropriations have been made by the Legislature in any three consecutive years, should be included in the State Mandates Apportionment System.\n\n• Existence of significant financial distress for applicant counties seeking to reduce their General Assistance Aid payments.","extra":{"byAppropriationType":{"State Operations":{"py":3161,"cy":3211,"by":3259}},"apiProgramLine":true},"children":[{"id":"exp/8000/8885/6900/f0001","kind":"fund","name":"General Fund","code":"0001","amounts":{"py":3161,"cy":3211,"by":3259},"byFundType":{"general":{"py":3161,"cy":3211,"by":3259}},"extra":{"fundType":"general","byAppropriationType":{"State Operations":{"py":3161,"cy":3211,"by":3259}}}}]},{"id":"exp/8000/8885/6905","kind":"program","name":"Mandates","code":"6905","amounts":{"py":87317,"cy":94103,"by":90607},"byFundType":{"general":{"py":85376,"cy":91643,"by":87661},"special":{"py":1941,"cy":2460,"by":2946}},"positions":{"py":0,"cy":0,"by":0},"extra":{"byAppropriationType":{"Local Assistance":{"py":87317,"cy":94103,"by":90607}},"apiProgramLine":true},"children":[{"id":"exp/8000/8885/6905/f0001","kind":"fund","name":"General Fund","code":"0001","amounts":{"py":85376,"cy":91643,"by":87661},"byFundType":{"general":{"py":85376,"cy":91643,"by":87661}},"extra":{"fundType":"general","byAppropriationType":{"Local Assistance":{"py":85376,"cy":91643,"by":87661}}}},{"id":"exp/8000/8885/6905/f0044","kind":"fund","name":"Motor Vehicle Account, State Transportation Fund","code":"0044","amounts":{"py":1869,"cy":2385,"by":2885},"byFundType":{"spe